00:16:09,185 --> 00:16:13,635
もう願いに嘘はない ここが好き！
No more lies in my wishes, I love this place!

131
00:16:14,315 --> 00:16:18,595
どんな世界も瞬間も輝く 愛が有るから
Every world and every moment shines because love is here.

132
