生きたいが死ねと言われ 死にたいが生きろと言われ
Told to die when I want to live, told to live when I want to die.

377
00:37:59,117 --> 00:38:02,117
幸せ自慢はダメ? 不幸嘆いててもダメ?
Is bragging about happiness bad? Is lamenting misfortune bad too?

378
